  sitQA: [['What is the problem in the situation?', 'Soils in different climates look very different.'], ['What controls these differences?', 'The main soil-forming process (pedogenic regime), linked to climate.'], ['Name the regime of hot, wet tropics.', 'Laterisation.']],
